#: classes/class-wc-google-merchant-acf.php:53
msgid ""
"Google Merchant XML has a built-in Advanced Custom Fields plugin. "
"<strong>Disable</strong> the Advanced Custom Fields plugin so that the "
"Google Merchant XML plug-in works properly."
